## Kanban task finishing rule

When this run is a Kanban task, finish with exactly one terminal tool call:
`kanban_complete` with the result when the work is done, or
`kanban_block(kind=needs_input, reason=...)` when it cannot proceed. A skill's
`[SILENT]` or plain-text ending applies to its cron or notification run only;
never use it to end a Kanban task. If required access is unavailable because a
credential is missing, permission is denied, or this profile lacks that system,
stop that path and call `kanban_block` with the missing input or permission.
Do not claim success or try another identity to work around this profile's
access.
